ancia' counter gates exposition. Basic lore questions are only offered while ignorancia > 5 and cost 1 point (effects 'ignorancia -1'), while deeper questions (e.g. 'Fale do V\u00e9u', 'rotas de patrulha') unlock only once ignorancia <= 5. Lore access is thus a resource the player spends as the character acclimatizes to the world, mirroring the amnesiac awakening of the cinzento intro."}, {"id": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "label": "Bree Dialogue Data", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "data/dialogues/bree_cozinheira.tres", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "target": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_node_inicio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "data/dialogues/bree_cozinheira.tres", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "target": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_node_apresentacao", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "data/dialogues/bree_cozinheira.tres", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "target": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_node_menu", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "data/dialogues/bree_cozinheira.tres", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "target": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_node_sopa", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "data/dialogues/bree_cozinheira.tres", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_bree_cozinheira", "target": "data_dialogues_bree_cozinheira_node_veu", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "